WEBVTT

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:08.100
Wonder what I should get today...

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:15.760
What a weird book... I don't remember seeing <i>this</i> in the library before.

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:17.620
What is it-kuru?

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.980
Let's see... there's a glass slipper.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:24.230
So, I guess it must be Cinderella...

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:26.630
It looks so realistic...

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:38.950
Miyuki?!

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:41.100
Kuru?

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:01.770
Where am I?! And why am I covered in cinders?!

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:07.070
Wait, come to think of it... that's what Cinderella means...

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:16.180
That's the castle!

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:18.890
And I'm dressed like this...

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:21.130
Does that mean that I'm...

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:22.380
...I'm...

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:25.990
...Cinderella?!

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:30.460
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:32.330
Smile Precure!

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:33.200
Let's go!

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:34.730
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:35.860
All together!

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:37.470
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:37.470 --> 00:01:39.670
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.340
Smile Precure!

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:47.180
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:52.650
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:57.820
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:03.750
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:08.630
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:08.630
So bright!

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:13.880
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:19.970
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:20.810
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:21.970
Let's go!

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:24.560
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:27.600
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:32.400
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:32.980
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:34.530
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:35.740
Everybody!

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:37.240
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:39.990
Fly to the future!

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:43.490
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:45.600
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:47.970
Smile Precure!

00:02:54.880 --> 00:03:00.090
Yes... that book is finally free from the confines of Märchenland-da wasa!

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:01.560
I reckon today's going to be something special!

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:03.560
Miyuki's sure late, ain't she?

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:07.040
I suspect she's merely engrossed in choosing an appropriate book.

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:08.910
Yeah, prolly!

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:11.160
It's gone, gone, gone gone!

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:14.310
My friends, it's gone-de gozaru!

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:17.920
Oh, my friend is gone-de gozaru!

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:24.620
Bad news-kuru!

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:27.120
Bad news travels fast-kuru!

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:29.890
That's it! That's the very book-de gozaru!

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.590
My thanks for tracking it down with such haste, Candy-de gozaru!

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:36.290
Pop-san, would you mind enlightening us as to the situation?

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:41.770
This book is none other than one of Märchenland's prized relics...

00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:44.670
...the Original Cinderella-de gozaru!

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:47.980
The Original Cinderella?

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:05.920
My name's Cinderella~!

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:12.830
It appears Miyuki-dono has been pulled into the tale of Cinderella-de gozaru!

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:16.170
Man, Miyuki sure does love that cleanin'.

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:20.140
Isn't this part of the story meant to be tough for her?

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:25.010
Pop-san, it's clear that there is more to this Original Cinderella than meets the eye...

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:30.550
All the Cinderella stories in the world are connected to this book.

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:34.370
It's the very source of all the joy that comes from reading the story of Cinderella-de gozaru.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.320
If it were to fall into the hands of those who would corrupt it...

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:39.470
Hand the book over-da wasa!

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.730
The heck are you doing here?!

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:48.440
We've come to take the Original Cinderella-da wasa!

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:51.410
So we can give her story the Bad End it deserves, of course!

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:56.090
If they were to give the Cinderella in these pages a Bad End...

00:04:56.090 --> 00:05:00.210
...then every Cinderella book in the world would receive the same Bad End!

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:03.790
That Cinderella is mine!

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:05.570
No, I want to ruin it-oni!

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:06.490
That's my role-da wasa!

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:08.660
Shove off, you old bat!

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:22.270
Candy! My friends!

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:29.430
I'm afraid it falls on to you to take the role of characters in the story, and protect it from their Bad Ends-de gozaru!

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:32.770
The fate of Cinderella is in your hands-de gozaru!

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.380
I dunno how I became Cinderella, but...

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:46.660
If it means I'm gonna win myself a charming prince...

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:51.470
...and get my Happy End, I'm up for it!

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:55.060
Oh, I'm afraid not my dear-da wasa!

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:01.040
Evil stepsister number one is here!

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:04.410
Along with evil stepsister number two-oni!

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:08.180
And I, your evil old stepmother-da wasa!

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.690
What are you three doing here?!

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:18.000
If we give you a Bad End here, then every Cinderella story around the world suffers it too-da wasa!

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:18.930
Seriously?!

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:22.100
So we're gonna make sure you get one seriously bad end!

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:29.360
Not happening! I'm gonna be the happiest Cinderella ever!

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:34.980
Laundry, laundry, lalala la~

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:44.450
My laundry!

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:49.920
Washing the floors, washing the floors~

00:06:50.690 --> 00:06:51.770
Oh, do excuse me!

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:57.320
But I had them so clean...

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:02.800
Cooking dinner, cooking dinner~

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:16.940
My lovely dinner...

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:19.350
I didn't even need to do anything-da wasa!

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:22.760
Those vile fiends!

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:26.560
Have Candy and her friends not taken their parts yet-de gozaru?!

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:28.160
We've got mail-oni!{TLC: screw this diction with a screwdriver =_=}

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:31.950
Oh look! Invitations to the castle!

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:37.050
The prince is holding a ball, in hopes that he may find himself a bride.

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:39.450
Alright! It's my time to shine!

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:40.670
Cinderella...

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:44.280
You won't be going to any balls while <i>I'm</i> around-da wasa!

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:50.490
Oh no! How will I be able to attend the ball now?

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:58.410
Just kidding! The story says my fairy godmother will appear to save me!

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:04.530
I'm Yayoi, your godmother for the evening.

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:07.800
Sorry, Cinderella... but they caught me too!

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:11.010
This rendition isn't going to be by the book, I'm afraid-da wasa!

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:14.480
No way...!

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:19.920
Ah, it's evening-da wasa! We're off to the ball-da wasa!

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:21.450
Yahoo!

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:25.430
Miyuki!

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:26.530
Yayoi-chan!

00:08:27.350 --> 00:08:30.020
Is that <i>you,</i> Akane-chan and Nao-chan?!

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:31.760
We're up here!

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:37.260
Wait, are you two acting as my mouse friends?!

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:39.570
Why do we have ta be the mice, anyway?

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:42.410
Hey, cheer up! We've got some friends to save!

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:44.700
Here you go!

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:47.210
What are you meant to be, Candy?

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:48.680
I'm the lizard-kuru!{TLC: "No, Candy, I don't mean this episode.  What role do you have in the entire series?"}

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:50.820
Thanks!

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:53.600
Yayoi, give 'em a blast of your magic!

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:55.160
Leave it to me!

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:59.720
Chi chin pui pui!

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:07.030
<i>Pui!</i>

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:15.600
Now that's more like it!

00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:19.320
Here, your glass slippers!

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:21.360
Oh, thanks!

00:09:22.510 --> 00:09:26.880
Remember, the magic spell breaks at midnight, so you'll need to be out of the castle by then!

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:28.510
Roger that!

00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:30.750
I mean, uhh...

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.620
...I understand.

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:38.130
Giddie up-kuru!

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:40.900
Why we gotta be horses?

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:41.830
Don't be like that!

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:45.630
Wow, a full moon...

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:49.240
And what comes out on a full moon? Werewolves!{TLC: お釜男}

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:53.590
There aren't any werewolves in Cinderella!

00:09:55.550 --> 00:10:00.630
I'm afraid your first evil stepsister is none other...

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:03.120
...than a big bad werewolf!

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:08.380
Can you do that?!

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:14.920
Are you all okay...?

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:18.930
Yeah, but forget that! He busted your pumpkin carriage!

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:25.960
Guess somebody isn't making it to the ball!

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:27.410
So long, brats!

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.580
This isn't good-kuru...

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:40.020
This does not bode well for the tale of Cinderella-de gozaru!

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:45.630
Happy!

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:52.530
Akanbe!

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:05.440
Thank you for coming, everyone. I am Prince Reika.{TLC: :3 }

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:10.080
Welcome to my ball. It is my hope that I shall find my bride here tonight.

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:13.750
Nobody's here...

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:16.050
Oh, but <i>we</i> are!

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:21.930
But unfortunately we may have scared off all the other guests!

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:24.030
Would you care to dance, Your Highness?

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.500
No, dance with <i>me</i>-oni!

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:27.260
No, <i>me</i>-da wasa!

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:29.180
You aren't even meant to be here!

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:32.740
Oh, shut up-da wasa! Some of us are still trying to find Mr. Right, dang it-da wasa!

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:34.140
I must... politely refuse.

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:37.010
Well you have to dance with someone-oni!

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:39.840
And it's going to be one of us three-da wasa!

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:41.650
I'm afraid your little Cinderella won't be making it!

00:11:41.650 --> 00:11:45.050
She had an accident, and I split just after her carriage did!{TLC: I c what u did thar :)}

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:47.620
Miyuki-san...

00:11:49.090 --> 00:11:51.790
This fairytale isn't finished yet!

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:55.700
I'll make it to the ball, carriage or no carriage!

00:11:56.860 --> 00:12:01.470
I am not letting them ruin Cinderella with their Bad Ends!

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:02.570
Miyuki...

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:04.810
That's the spirit, Miyuki!

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:05.790
Keep fighting-kuru!

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:11.310
There you are!

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:15.680
I was waiting for you at the castle, but I came looking when you didn't show up...

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:18.580
You'd better hurry, or you won't make it in time!

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:21.050
That's it!

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:27.430
Oh my! Somebody, help me!

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:35.790
Kuru!

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:53.120
Are you alright, fair maiden?

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:01.130
May I have the pleasure of this dance?

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:06.330
Why... the pleasure would be mine!

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:14.070
Though truth be told, I've never actually danced before.

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:15.840
What is there for me to do?

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:20.910
Don't worry about that! I never danced before, either, but I'm sure we'll be just fine!

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:26.750
It's not every day we get to go to the ball! Let's just enjoy it, Your Highness!

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:27.950
Quite true.

00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:44.490
Well, that takes care 'a that.

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:49.040
How lovely...

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:56.050
They made it through the ball just fine, at least-de gozaru!

00:13:57.150 --> 00:14:00.180
Cinderella, we only have five minutes until midnight!

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:03.270
You need to leave the castle before then!

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:06.860
And don't forget ta leave a glass slipper behind as ya go!

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:07.880
Okay!

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:13.130
Right, scene 11{yes, I counted}! "The Prince in Pursuit of Cinderella!" And, action!

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:17.230
I'm sorry, fair prince, but my time has come to leave...

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.340
Ahem...

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:20.830
Wait! Where are you going?!

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:21.770
Please, come back!

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:25.740
How long is this staircase?!

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:29.660
Dang, we're too late for the ball.

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:32.420
But you won't be getting your happy end that easily-oni!

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:33.990
You'll have to get through us first-da wasa!

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:35.920
These losers again?!

00:14:37.860 --> 00:14:39.560
Get out of there-da wasa!

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:41.560
That tickles!

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:43.560
What are you two doing?

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:46.660
I'll give him a taste of my magic!

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:48.420
Chi chin pui pui...

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.600
Not if I squash you pests flat first!

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:00.510
Are you alright?

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:05.710
I am now.

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:07.790
Hey, give the shippin' a rest, will ya?{TLC: =_=}{QC:I'm so glad this made the final cut}

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:10.390
And off you come!

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:15.710
Now, all I have to do is collect your slipper, as you leave before midnight.

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:19.060
Yeah, that's not happening! Last resort time...

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:22.010
Come on out, Akanbe!

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:26.670
Akanbe!

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:28.640
Oni?

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:30.120
Why the red nose-oni?!

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:31.750
Ah, crap, wrong one!

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:33.410
Well, too late now anyway!

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:36.610
Good luck picking up your glass slipper now, princey!

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:42.030
If the prince doesn't keep the slipper, then the entire story's gonna be ruined!

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:43.590
Come on, guys!

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:48.480
Umm... I left my Smile Pact back in the real world.

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:49.580
As did I, I'm afraid.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:51.560
Ain't no way we could use ours...

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:53.200
...with mouse paws!

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:57.970
Fine, looks like it's all down to me!

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:02.780
Ready?

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:06.200
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:07.230
Go!

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:09.620
Go, go!

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:11.970
Let's Go: Happy!

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:36.060
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:39.530
Cure Happy!

00:16:41.990 --> 00:16:44.600
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:54.250
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.880
Doesn't really work on my own, does it?

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:01.700
Yeah, you're kinda missin' the other four lights.

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:03.170
Akanbe.

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:06.040
Akanbe?

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:09.610
Akanbe!

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:14.190
Wait, aren't you gonna fight me?

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:16.210
Akan.

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:18.980
Akanbe!

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:21.380
What's going on here?!

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:23.100
Happy, you have to hurry!

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:29.680
We need that Akanbe purified so we can collect the glass slipper, and have you out of here by midnight!

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.610
That sneaky little...!

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:33.820
Akanbe!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.080
Get back here!

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:37.170
Come back!

00:17:37.170 --> 00:17:39.170
Akan, Akan, Akanbe!

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:44.170
It's too fast-kuru!

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:46.330
Aww crap, we're runnin' outta time!

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:51.180
Akanbe!

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:53.650
Akan!

00:17:55.910 --> 00:17:56.980
Akan...

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:00.190
Be!

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:02.990
A-ka!

00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:05.340
Happy!

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:06.910
One minute left!

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:09.670
I know-kuru! I can use the Sweets Decor-kuru!

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:12.590
Let's Go: Sweets!

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:22.150
Akanbe...

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:24.840
Was that... a sugar rush?

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:25.670
Cut the jokes!

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:27.050
Now's your chance, Happy-kuru!

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:36.360
I am not letting you ruin the story of Cinderella! It means too much to everyone who's read it!

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:42.920
Pegasus, grant me your power!

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:50.140
Princess Happy!

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:54.260
Man, Happy's really into it today.

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:57.850
Quite. I was not aware of how strong her love for Cinderella is!

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:02.400
Precure...

00:19:02.760 --> 00:19:05.460
Cinderella Happy...

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:09.570
Shower!

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:16.050
Akanbe...

00:19:19.070 --> 00:19:21.360
That was way too much power!

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:31.860
The glass slipper is back where it belongs.

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:32.980
Not only that...

00:19:38.560 --> 00:19:44.630
...Cinderella made it home before the stroke of midnight...

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:46.600
They did it-de gozaru!

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:49.000
We're finally at the last scene-de gozaru!

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:55.170
We have come in search of the owner of this glass slipper.

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:59.640
She whom the glass slipper fits is the one fit to be my bride.

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:01.940
Bring the slipper to me.

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:03.110
As you command, Your Highness!

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:04.350
Whoa!

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:10.050
I'm afraid the story's not over just yet! Well? Come try the slipper!

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:12.990
I was wondering where they got to...

00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:14.650
Ain't you caused enough havoc already?!

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:16.030
Let me try it on-oni!

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:18.730
Hooray!

00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:24.590
Oh, I'm so happy-oni! We can go on honeymoon to my oni paradise-oni!

00:20:24.590 --> 00:20:25.750
Hey, it broke!

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:27.070
Miyuki,

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:30.680
I found it-kuru! Here's the real glass slipper-kuru!

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:32.880
Give that back, you little furball-da wasa!

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:52.060
It fits, Cinderella! The glass slipper fits you perfectly!

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:55.530
Cinderella, will you be my bride?

00:20:56.430 --> 00:20:58.500
It would be my honor!

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:04.770
Alright, we got our happy end!

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:09.180
We're back!

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:11.620
What a waste of time-da wasa!

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:14.520
Thanks, everyone.

00:21:15.070 --> 00:21:17.130
Whatcha thankin' us for?

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:20.890
Cinderella would never have gotten to be happy without your help!

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:29.230
Cinderella's all about her friends, and her fairy godmother, helping her to be happy...

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:33.290
We got our happy ending because you guys helped out!

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:35.570
Guess so!

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:37.220
Glad we could help out.

00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:40.110
But you did most of the work, Miyuki-chan!

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:45.090
Your hard work and determination made you the perfect fit for Cinderella, Miyuki-san.

00:21:48.130 --> 00:21:51.300
Well, the major details of the story have remained as they should, but...

00:21:51.300 --> 00:21:54.460
...I fear the story may have undergone some slight changes, alas-de gozaru.

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:56.320
One can hope people won't notice...

00:21:57.010 --> 00:21:58.560
It'll be fine-kuru!

00:21:58.560 --> 00:22:03.570
We just made Cinderella's story even more exciting-kuru!

00:23:39.330 --> 00:23:43.520
Golden treasures, buried beneath the waves! Just waitin' for me to find 'em!

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:44.880
What's gotten into you, Akane?

00:23:44.880 --> 00:23:47.800
Treasure! I was wonderin' what my treasure is, ya know.

00:23:47.800 --> 00:23:49.150
It's whatever you take pride in!

00:23:49.150 --> 00:23:50.150
Volleyball!

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:52.390
Okonomiyaki! Making it, I mean!

00:23:52.390 --> 00:23:57.190
It's gotta be something precious that you'd miss if it was gone-kuru!

00:23:57.700 --> 00:23:59.260
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:04.380
Find your ultra happy smile!
